==Description==
After charging the ability, temporarily increases [[attributes]].

Gains experience with each activation of the ability, depending on amount of attribute points available or allocated.

== Pet Ability ==
Geode reduces level requirements by:
<br><math>L_M \times 0.4</math>

If level reduction is greater than 50, instead reduces level requirements by:
<br><math>50 + (L_M \times 0.4 - 50)^{0.7}</math>

Geode's ability charges over:
<br><math>\frac{30}{P^{0.15} + 1}</math>
<br>seconds (minimum 1).

On activation, Geode increases all attributes (except Versatility) by:
<br><math>X = \Bigg \lfloor L^{0.75}\times 0.8 \Bigg \rceil + 1</math>
<br>If over 100, instead increases by:
<br><math>X = \left(\Bigg \lfloor L^{0.75}\times 0.8 \Bigg \rceil - 100\right)^{0.5} + 100</math>
<br>The chosen attribute additionally receives:
<br><math>\frac{X}{2}</math>

The ability stays active for:
<br><math>\frac{L}{10} + 2</math>
<br>seconds (max 30).

where:
* <math>L_M = \text{Max Geode Level}</math>
** ''N.B. This is reset on changing Pet, [[Exile]], or [[Realm]]''
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Geode accrues experience on ability activation, equal to:
<br><math>(D^2 \times \frac{A}{100} + F) \times M</math>

This XP pool is distributed over time, at a rate each second of:
<br><math>1 + \frac{X}{10}</math>

where:
* <math>D = \text{Ability Duration}</math>
* <math>A = \text{Total Attribute Points}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>
* <math>X = \text{Accrued Pet XP}</math>

